OL,3,AHenry Nowak's family criticise killer's
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family have also called it a
OL,7,F"disgrace" that Digwa's mother, Kiran
OL,8,FKaur, jailed for three years for hiding
OL,9,Fthe knife, may be released early in
OL,10,FDecember.
